  "plain": "In the 1980s in Washington, a colonel working for the Joint Chiefs of Staff, the group of top military commanders who advise the president, said yes when asked straight out whether there was really a UFO cover-up. The physicist John Brandenburg says he asked the question himself, and that the colonel answered: \"Yes. That's all I can tell you. The rest you can figure out for yourself.\" Brandenburg tells it as a rare moment of an insider admitting that the government hides what it knows."
